abstract: "Research software and versioned analyses for a manuscript under review at IEEE ICIT 2027, reporting a focused three-site study of power telemetry recovery, including the common-observed-target forecast analysis version 2. Original code is MIT; telemetry, derived data, manuscript content and third-party artifacts retain separate terms."
